  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 1807.02 Removal of Commercial Driver License Restriction",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1807.02 Removal of Commercial Driver License Restriction.\n\n(a) Each driver who requests to have a restriction removed from their commercial driver license\n\nshall comply with the provisions of Saf-C 1008.07.\n\n(b) Each commercial driver who requests removal of a restriction shall furnish to the division the following on form DSMV 329:\n\n(1) Legal name;\n\n(2) Legal address;\n\n(3) Mailing address;\n\n(4) Date of birth;\n\n(5) Social security number, if required pursuant to RSA 263:90, I(d);\n\n(6) Indication of the restriction to be removed; and\n\n(7) Signature of the applicant and date signed.\n\n(c) Upon the receipt of the completed form DSMV 329 by the division, the applicant shall pass:\n\n(1) The knowledge examination set forth in Saf-C 1805.01(b)(2); and\n\n(2) The road skills examination set forth in Saf-C 1806.01.\n\n(d) In the event the applicant successfully passes the restriction removal requirements, the director shall issue a new commercial driver license.\n\nSource. #8405, eff 8-2-05, (formerly Saf-C 1804.02); ss by #10523, eff 2-18-14, EXPIRED: 2-18-24\n\nNew. #13963, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 5-13-24; ss by #14100, eff 10-18-24, EXPIRES: 10-18-34",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c1800.html"
